# Exported documents the collaboration examples write at runtime. Unanchored on
# purpose: the FastAPI example has already moved once, and a checkout that ran
# it at the old path keeps the ignored directory there after the update. A
# path-pinned rule stops covering those files the moment the example moves,
# which turns a stale exported document into something `git add -A` will stage.
.superdoc-state/

